4"}],"movies":[{"id":2028156,"n":"Stealth Bastard Deluxe Launch Trailer","t":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2028156/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1560958330","hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/209190/9902/82504d6c489eafe2305c849ac9f121a60b4b04f8/1751248995/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1560958330","mp4":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steam/apps/2028156/movie480.mp4"}],"genres":["Action","Indie"],"features":["Single-player","Steam Achievements","Steam Cloud","Steam Trading Cards","Family Sharing"],"platforms":{"windows":true,"mac":true,"linux":true},"controller":null,"dev":["Curve Studios"],"pub":["Curve Games"],"released":"Nov 28, 2012","meta":80,"langs":["English"],"min":[["OS","Windows XP SP2 or better, Vista, Win7"],["Processor","Dual Core 2.5Ghz"],["Memory","2 GB RAM"],["Graphics","DirectX 8.0 compatible"],["DirectX\u00ae","8.0"],["Hard Drive","250 MB HD space"]],"rec":[["Other Requirements","Broadband Internet connection"]],"deck":0,"blurb":"Most stealth games ask for patience, but Stealth Bastard Deluxe asks for speed. The player guides a defenseless infiltrator, equipped with nothing but a pair of stealth goggles, through a hostile facility. The character carries no weapons and wears no armor, a single sighting is fatal, and survival depends on staying in shadow and moving between hiding places at the right moments.\n\nEach room works as a compact puzzle of timing and positioning, with traps and patrolling machinery to read and avoid. Deluxe is an expanded version of the original Stealth Bastard. It is a single-player game that suits fans of precise, trial-and-error platformers who like some stealth in the mix."}}